; Filled icons for the flat Workbench (plan 2026-11-01-amarchy-filled-icon-set.md, F3).
; One row per target: `match = phosphor-name`. tools/gen_lucide_icons.py renders each Phosphor Fill glyph
; (build/phosphor, @phosphor-icons/web in the Makefile) to dist/Amarchy/Icons/lucide.dat; an unknown icon name fails the build.
; match is one of
;   a path          SYS:Prefs/Font         (volume or assign, then the .info path without ".info")
;   a default       def_drawer             (ENVARC:Sys/def_NAME.info; def_disk, def_drawer, def_tool, def_project, def_trashcan, def_RAM, every def_* of OS 3.2 Prefs/Env-Archive/Sys)
;   a type fallback type:disk type:drawer type:tool type:project type:garbage type:kick type:device type:net
